# The portfolio is the same document as the home page with its page state set,
# so /portfolio has to serve the home document as-is (a 200 rewrite, not a
# redirect). The target is / rather than /index.html: Pages redirects
# /index.html to / itself, and that redirect leaked through the rewrite.
/portfolio        /             200
# The v1 site used a real portfolio.html. Keep old links and resumes working.
/portfolio.html   /portfolio    301
/portfolio/       /portfolio    301
